# SIES — what never enters a build context.
#
# Two reasons a line is here. Either it makes the build slower (node_modules and
# .git are the two that matter — the daemon copies the whole context before the
# first instruction runs), or it must not end up in an image at all.
#
# The second kind is the important kind: an image is pushed, pulled, cached and
# read by anyone who can run `docker run`. A .env.production baked into a layer
# is a secret that cannot be recalled, because deleting it in a later layer
# leaves it in the earlier one.
#
# SCOPE: Docker reads the .dockerignore that sits in the BUILD CONTEXT. Our two
# contexts are ./backend and ./frontend/admin_dashboard, so each of those needs
# its own file; this one covers builds run from the repository root and is the
# pattern the other two should follow. If backend/.dockerignore does not exist,
# `docker build ./backend` sends everything under backend/ — including media/
# and any .env sitting there — into the image.

# ── Must not be in an image ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
traefik/traefik.env
traefik/acme.json
backups/
*.dump
*.sql
*.sql.gz
media/
backend/media/
logs/
*.log
*.pem
*.key

# ── Slows the build down ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
dist/
build/
.vite/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ── Not needed at runtime ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Documentation, the compose files themselves, and the deploy scripts run on the
# HOST, not inside a container. An image that carries pull_and_deploy.sh is an
# image that carries the ability to redeploy the system.
docs/
scripts/
*.md
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
traefik/

# collectstatic runs during the deploy and writes into the image's own volume;
# a stale copy from the developer's machine would shadow it.
staticfiles/
backend/staticfiles/

# ── Editors and OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
